                // - sonarjs/cognitive-complexity: eslint relaxes it in replica
                // - sonarjs/concise-regex: eslint relaxes it in fingerprint
                // - sonarjs/constructor-for-side-effects: eslint relaxes it in replica
                // - sonarjs/no-clear-text-protocols: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - sonarjs/no-collection-size-mischeck: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - sonarjs/no-hardcoded-passwords: reports code that eslint accepts
