                // - unicorn/no-immediate-mutation: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - unicorn/no-invalid-fetch-options: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - unicorn/no-null: eslint relaxes it in studio, auth-ui, docs and 17 more
                // - unicorn/no-useless-iterator-to-array: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - unicorn/no-useless-spread: reports code that eslint accepts
                // - unicorn/numeric-separators-style: eslint relaxes it in fingerprint; elsewhere it reports code that eslint accepts
                // - unicorn/prefer-code-point: eslint relaxes it in fingerprint
                // - unicorn/prefer-event-target: eslint relaxes it in replica
